{
  "date": "2026-11-28",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "微信在苹果手机上推出NFC交通卡，碰一下就能进站",
  "title_en": "WeChat launches an NFC transit card on iPhone: just tap to enter the station",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "据移动支付网11月27日报道，苹果手机上的微信8.0.80版本在“卡包”里增加了NFC交通卡功能。用户坐地铁或公交的时候，不用再打开二维码，只要把手机靠近闸机就能通过。",
      "en": "According to a Mpaypass report on November 27, version 8.0.80 of WeChat on iPhone has added an NFC transit card function to its \"Card Wallet\". When users take the subway or a bus, they no longer need to open a QR code; they just hold the phone close to the gate to get through."
    },
    {
      "zh": "NFC是一种近距离无线通信技术，手机和机器离得很近时就能交换信息。以前，很多人在中国坐车时用的是微信或支付宝里的乘车码，需要扫码。",
      "en": "NFC is a short-range wireless communication technology: a phone and a machine can exchange information when they are very close to each other. In the past, many people in China used the ride codes in WeChat or Alipay when taking transport, which required scanning a code."
    },
    {
      "zh": "微信还没有公布哪些城市可以用这个功能。有的城市开卡的时候需要先充值，有的城市不需要。用户可以在微信的“我—卡包”里添加交通卡，选好城市，再到小程序里完成开通。",
      "en": "WeChat has not yet announced which cities can use this function. In some cities you need to top up first when opening the card; in others you don't. Users can add a transit card under \"Me – Card Wallet\" in WeChat, choose their city, and then finish activating it in a mini-program."
    },
    {
      "zh": "今年4月，支付宝已经接入了苹果钱包。现在，支付宝的NFC交通卡可以在13个城市使用。",
      "en": "In April this year, Alipay already connected to Apple Wallet. Now Alipay's NFC transit card can be used in 13 cities."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
    "name_en": "Mpaypass (China Mobile Payment Network)",
    "url": "https://www.mpaypass.com.cn/news/202611/27192032.html"
  },
